# [Landing Party Rosters](landing_rosters)

The bridge crew of the ship that answers Stillwater - and, when they go down to Mereth, the
landing party as well. You go down as the person you have been all evening, so this file
is the cast for both.

`Roles:` is what a scene GUARDS on (`if security`). A post without one falls back to the
console it names, so Reyes at science satisfies `if science` with nothing written here.

`Skills:` is what a CHECK rolls with (`check engineering 9`): d10 plus the skill plus one
for each crew member standing beside you who has it. A job with no number is worth 2.
Each crew member is best at their own side quest's work, and every skill below 3 is there
so someone else can help.

Kept in its own file on purpose. `crew_load_amd` parses with `amd_crew_data` and the story
content is read with `amd_mission_data`; one file read by two parsers is a trap.

